SY_TALK("itWAIhPjP-Q",[[0,["I’ll talk to you about the Right Side,"]],[4,["Right Side sympathetic nervous system,"]],[8,["which is expressed by our subtle energy","of Mahasaraswati,"]],[22,["which gives us the power to act."]],[30,["By [the] Left Side we desire"]],[35,["and by using the Right Side, the power","of Pingala Nadi, we act."]],[44,["I was telling you about the Right Side","the other day."]],[50,["Let us see how our Right Side is built up."]],[55,["I am sorry for people who have come","for the first time"]],[58,["but every time when I start the introduction","to the subject,"]],[62,["again it becomes the same but later on","I’ll explain to you about Sahaj Yoga."]],[70,["Now this Right Side, Pingala Nadi, is a","very, very important energy-giving energy"]],[86,["which makes us act and activate."]],[91,["Now this one is made of all the five","elements:"]],[98,["you know all the five elements that have","created"]],[101,["our physical being and our mental being."]],[106,["That’s how it helps us to work out all","our physical and mental problems,"]],[114,["mental activities and mental and physical","growth."]],[123,["Now this, being made by those five","elements,"]],[130,["when, first time, human beings started","thinking"]],[136,["of doing some action, about anything,","say in India,"]],[145,["they first thought, “Why not, somehow","or other,"]],[148,["reach to the principle of these elements,"]],[152,["which is beyond physics, which is beyond","chemistry?”"]],[158,["And to reach to that point,"]],[163,["they thought it would be better if we try","to invoke"]],[171,["or to awaken the Deities which are","governing those five elements."]],[180,["This was a very big mistake though,","I should say,"]],[184,["because human beings, whatever they","take up,"]],[188,["they do not know where to stop!"]],[191,["If you tell them that you have to clean","your teeth every day,"]],[198,["then they’ll go on cleaning it twelve times","in twelve hours."]],[203,["[If] you tell them anything, they’ll go","so far"]],[207,["that they will destroy the instrument which","is supposed to be looked after."]],[215,["That’s the nature of human beings: they","cannot have brakes to themselves."]],[220,["They do not have common sense as far as","balancing their life."]],[226,["So, anything you give them, they become","so mad after it"]],[236,["that, in Marathi, there’s a word"]],[239,["that [means that] they ultimately put ashes","on their head,"]],[241,["to say, to declare that, “I am dead now,","I have become ashes.”"]],[246,["Like that, they get so frantic"]],[249,["that even while doing this awakening","of these principles"]],[253,["they forgot, lost their sight,"]],[257,["that we are after all Spirit and not","these elements."]],[261,["We are beyond that, we have to reach beyond","that."]],[265,["All these elements are only useful for us"]],[269,["to achieve a state in which we can create","things"]],[277,["and we can have more time to devote"]],[282,["to meditation to enjoy our Self-realisation."]],[287,["They got completely blinded by the advances","they made on this side"]],[294,["which is, in pure and simple words,","materialism."]],[300,["They became so responsible, so efficient."]],[305,["First in the Vedas, it’s written, the first","stanza is such that,"]],[313,["“By reading these Vedas if you do not know"]],[319,["your Spirit then it is absolutely useless.”"]],[323,["But this stanza they always close down","I think."]],[326,["Then they started worshipping those","Deities, this, that,"]],[329,["exciting them and doing all ritualism","and all that."]],[332,["And they just went into it headlong,","absolutely headlong."]],[337,["They would not turn back."]],[341,["So by exciting these elements,"]],[344,["they discovered the principles of these","elements;"]],[348,["for example, they discovered that gravity","is the essence of the Mother Earth."]],[353,["But [actually] it is not."]],[357,["That is not the essence of the Mother","Earth,"]],[360,["that is the energy that is asserted by Her,"]],[364,["but Her essence is Her fragrance."]],[367,["They could not cross that limit where they","could see really the subtle thing"]],[373,["which was [that] the subtle principle","of this energy"]],[379,["of gravity is the fragrance."]],[384,["All the fragrances come from Her."]],[388,["Of course man-made [fragrances] there are,","that’s different,"]],[391,["but even the man-made are also coming","from Her,"]],[395,["if you go, trace, source it up to the point,","it is from there."]],[400,["Like that they went on discovering","the subtler, so-called subtler, energies"]],[407,["or the principles of these elements, from","the Vedas time."]],[411,["Then it became the science."]],[413,["People started studying physics, chemistry,","this, that:"]],[417,["understanding what was there before them"]],[422,["by going into it and trying to find out","what is it made of."]],[429,["For example, they went into atoms,"]],[433,["they went into molecules and things and","they tried to find out."]],[438,["And there they find the oscillation","of the protons"]],[444,["and they find the oscillation of these","atoms  [and] they just can’t understand,"]],[449,["“Now, from where this energy of this","oscillation is coming?”"]],[456,["They could not capture that energy so they","thought,"]],[460,["“Better use the energy.” So they started","using the energy."]],[465,["Now it has gone to such a limit of the","whole thing is,"]],[468,["now I read, saw that, microchips or","something coming up."]],[473,["After some time you won’t be using (your)","hands or head or anything,"]],[478,["it will be that microchips will be going","on."]],[481,["But with this kind of a thing, with this","extreme behaviour,"]],[484,["you will become a machine yourself, a slave","of the machine."]],[488,["Today the petrol is exhausted, tomorrow","electricity is exhausted,"]],[492,["then what are you going to do? You don’t","know even to count two plus two!"]],[496,["So you are left without any counting."]],[499,["You will become the same primitive man"]],[501,["and I don’t know what you will be doing,"]],[504,["climbing on the trees and living like","monkeys?"]],[507,["I don’t know what will happen."]],[510,["So all this advancement that you did has","gone too far."]],[516,["But as a result of too much efficiency,","too much responsibility and all that,"]],[522,["you became sort of addicted to it"]],[525,["and then, with that, you started dominating","other people."]],[530,["The machinery came in; with that you","produced such a lot of machinery stuff"]],[535,["that you didn’t know what to do, so you had","to find out"]],[537,["markets where you’ll sell them, so you","started"]],[540,["capturing other markets where you started","selling them"]],[542,["and that’s how all these economic problems","and all these have started."]],[546,["There are developing countries, there are","developed countries,"]],[549,["all things going on in this mad world.","All right!"]],[552,["But we reach a point now where we realise"]],[557,["that this machine has done something","nonsensical within us."]],[561,["When we reach that point,"]],[563,["we start thinking, “Now, what are we","to do?”"]],[567,["We have been very responsible,"]],[569,["not you people but your forefathers maybe,"]],[572,["who went to fight the whole world and do","this"]],[576,["and they had to be at right time at right","places and do all sorts of things."]],[581,["By that over-responsibility you became","sort of fed up."]],[587,["You just didn’t know what to do. For","example, morning you wear a grey suit,"]],[591,["in the night you have to wear a tailcoat"]],[593,["and then if you have to drink your wine,"]],[596,["you have to take a separate glass;","or for that, this."]],[599,["It became too much messy, [so] you said,","“Throw them in the sea!"]],[603,["We’re not going to have all this nonsense."]],[606,["We have collected all these forms"]],[607,["and horrible things that have made us","so rigid.”"]],[610,["That’s how you tried to throw away","everything."]],[612,["But even then when you throw away, where","do you go?"]],[616,["I mean you have to exist, you cannot just","hang in the air."]],[619,["So you said now take another style."]],[621,["And the another style is even worse, much","worse."]],[626,["Because then: no responsibility, no","respect, no understanding."]],[634,["So this power goes absolutely zero and you","are tired very soon."]],[639,["I have seen, I mean in the BBC and all","that, young people,"]],[643,["and I am a very old woman compared to them,"]],[647,["after saying two three words, “Haahh!”","they go down."]],[652,["Again after saying something, “Haahh!”","This is very big acting these days!"]],[657,["In any play you see a person says, “Haahh!”"]],[661,["What does it take to act for this kind","of a thing?"]],[664,["This is what is very common now, you","notice it."]],[667,["The reason is you are tired, you are","absolutely tired. Why?"]],[673,["Because your brain is the same old brain"]],[679,["and you have taken a new life, and you","cannot adjust yourself to that."]],[684,["You say that, “Now I am sitting down,","doing nothing."]],[687,["I am not going to be efficient anymore and","all that, I’m sitting down,”"]],[690,["[but] the brain is going, “chuk, chuk,","chuk, chuk, chuk, chuk, chuk, chuk,”"]],[692,["morning till evening. How to stop this","brain?"]],[695,["This brain is working so hard, using up all","your energy"]],[699,["[so] you have no strength."]],[702,["So to counteract you will say, “Let’s take","to some sort of a thing"]],[706,["by which we go out of this madness.”","Let’s take to something"]],[710,["that takes you [to], as we call it,","the Right or the Left Side,"]],[715,["take something like say hasheesh,","or something  —"]],[719,["like another thing they took — LSD, to go","to the right or to the left."]],[724,["Now what happens with that you know","very well."]],[727,["Now, thank God, you have realised also","that that was nonsensical also,"]],[732,["that was no good. These are two areas","within us"]],[735,["which are called as Adi Bhautik and","Adi Daivik."]],[741,["Now, the Adi Bhautik are the ones which","take you"]],[745,["to the Left Side is the subconscious."]],[748,["And the Adi Daivik are the ones where you","try to invoke the devas"]],[753,["and all that on the right hand side,"]],[756,["that one is the Adi Daivik where we call it","supra-conscious area."]],[763,["These two are of no use to human beings,","actually."]],[767,["They are not meant for you. They are meant","for people who are dead,"]],[772,["who are dead souls, who are good","for nothing."]],[776,["Now, they cannot get Realisation."]],[779,["It’s not meant for you. That’s the area","you should not reside in."]],[783,["But you enter into these areas because","of extreme natures."]],[788,["Some people by going into these drugs,"]],[791,["some [by] taking to some sort of movements"]],[794,["like mesmerism, spiritualism and all sorts","of isms."]],[798,["Some people onto the right hand side like","taking to"]],[801,["what you call these people who are","racialists"]],[805,["and all such organisations which are","racialist and this and that"]],[809,["and you know all that kind of a people,","like Hitlerish type."]],[813,["All this is nothing but is a kind of","an intoxicant"]],[817,["which makes you forget the reality that you","are a human being,"]],[821,["that you have to become the Spirit. That","you are the Spirit is the reality."]],[828,["Now the present trend in the Western life","is very much set"]],[833,["in this country, about which I am very","much concerned."]],[837,["I have talked about [this] to many people","in person, and also otherwise,"]],[842,["that the quality of mind —"]],[845,["because we are with the English, let’s","talk about the English people —"]],[849,["quality of mind of English is excellent,","I have said it always."]],[854,["And the young people of England have","a very good quality of mind,"]],[859,["but their heart is like this."]],[863,["They are frightened of what? God alone","knows, but they are frightened."]],[866,["Or they have taken this course? I don’t","know."]],[869,["Now to do any work, also they are","frightened."]],[872,["Supposing we put this colour then it may","not match:"]],[876,["[if] it doesn’t match it doesn’t matter.","What does it matter?"]],[879,["Because of those previous ideas they are","so frightened of doing anything."]],[886,["Though they say they have broken all","those ideas"]],[888,["and they have taken to a new liberated","ways and all that."]],[891,["But this liberation is also another madness"]],[894,["in which their fear has not gone."]],[897,["So the quality of mind"]],[900,["of we the English Sahaja Yogis and English","people is excellent."]],[905,["If you talk to them you will think you are","talking to a scholar;"]],[908,["I mean no less than Shakespeare!"]],[911,["They could be very well read."]],[914,["They will know about anything you ask them,","“What is this road?”"]],[916,["“This is the road!” “Now, what’s the name","of this road?” “This is the gentleman.”"]],[920,["Who was he, his grandfather, what he did,"]],[922,["what was the gossip about him, scandals,","everything!"]],[925,["You can get everything from them. They","know everything about everything."]],[932,["Sometimes I am amazed the way people know","about things,"]],[936,["about all the details as to how many women","he had,"]],[939,["and how many wives he divorced and what","he did"]],[942,["and where he went and what he wrote.","Take anyone!"]],[946,["Take a writer, or take an artist, take","a hooligan, or take a robber"]],[951,["or anyone who has appeared on","the newspaper."]],[954,["As if they have drunk all the newspaper","into their memory."]],[957,["The whole thing is so clear cut in their","mind that it’s sometimes amazing."]],[961,["But if you tell them to fix one chair,"]],[967,["never trust that chair!"]],[972,["Never trust it!"]],[974,["If you ask them to do anything, they’ll","tell you,"]],[978,["“All right, tomorrow at 7 sharp, I’ll be","there!”"]],[981,["Even if he comes after seven days, thank","your [lucky] stars!"]],[987,["I have known people who have done this","to me"]],[990,["[and] now it’s four years, I have never","seen their faces again."]],[994,["They are supposed to be XYZ from Oxford","and ABCD from Cambridge."]],[1003,["They have got first class first and this","and that"]],[1006,["[but] if you go into their rooms, you will","find it’s a pigsty!"]],[1010,["You don’t know where you have landed."]],[1013,["I mean, you don’t believe that it belongs","to any educated person!"]],[1016,["There’s no sense of responsibility left","in their head."]],[1020,["I mean this energy that is working","in the head,"]],[1023,["if it is not put into a responsible","channel,"]],[1027,["[then it’s] no wonder we find every third","person is a paranoid:"]],[1031,["something wrong with the brain."]],[1032,["What is wrong with the brain is that","so much energy is here"]],[1036,["and you are not channelising it at all!"]],[1038,["By what ways are we to channelise it?"]],[1043,["Even after realisation, I find people have","no respect for anything."]],[1050,["Sometimes it’s most surprising that wit","all this brain activity going on,"]],[1054,["they get all the satisfaction from","the Spirit,"]],[1057,["they are raising the Kundalini and all","that,"]],[1059,["but they have lost that capacity to be","responsible."]],[1065,["And that’s why, in Sahaja Yoga also, they","are not responsible."]],[1068,["This goes on not only about their own","private work"]],[1073,["but about Sahaja Yoga, about everything."]],[1075,["So this quality of mind has no heart."]],[1079,["It has heart in nothing!"]],[1082,["Supposing I am telling you something: I","don’t know about Sahaja Yogis as such,"]],[1086,["but now I have seen with people,"]],[1088,["[if] you give them a lecture for one year,","one hour, it’s lost, finished!"]],[1092,["They are just the same! What has happened?"]],[1095,["It’s only the vibrations, it’s only how you","work it out"]],[1099,["that the life changes and all that."]],[1101,["But as far as they are concerned, nothing","is recorded in the memory."]],[1104,["Sometimes I feel how do I talk? Is it","too much on their heads"]],[1109,["or below their feet? Where is it flowing?"]],[1112,["So the reason is that the heart is not","there."]],[1117,["If you register it through your heart, you","will do it."]],[1122,["If you put your heart into things, you will","do it."]],[1126,["The heart is, as I told you, is chicken-","hearted,"]],[1130,["is absolutely chicken-hearted."]],[1133,["And that’s why, this is what is lacking in","our character."]],[1137,["For that now the stage has reached"]],[1142,["[that] we have to raise our Right Side, not","the Left Side."]],[1145,["Our Right Side is absolutely finished"]],[1148,["and there the leader of the Right Side are","two persons."]],[1152,["The Deities are two persons."]],[1154,["Of course Brahmadeva is the one who","is The Creator,"]],[1157,["who has created this Universe and who","is The One who is busy"]],[1161,["still creating and doing lots of things","for you people."]],[1165,["But I would suggest that you have to pay","attention"]],[1169,["to two ideals we had in the history,"]],[1173,["for this, to understand what sort of ideals","we should have."]],[1176,["Because the Right Side is a Rajoguna"]],[1179,["is the one by which you become majestic,","you become royal,"]],[1184,["you achieve all the Rajoguna as you know","that."]],[1188,["Now two persons are really to be followed","in this."]],[1194,["One of them is Shri Ram."]],[1196,["Shri Ram resides on the Right Heart and","is the Father."]],[1202,["He is the Father and He is the fatherhood."]],[1207,["He is the one who came on this Earth","to teach us"]],[1209,["how to be a father as a king."]],[1213,["He is a Father King, He is a Benevolent","King,"]],[1216,["which was described before by Plato.","He is the Benevolent King."]],[1221,["He was the ideal that came on this Earth","to teach us"]],[1225,["how to be responsible to others, how","to respect others,"]],[1232,["how to understand the feelings of others."]],[1236,["To such an extent He went, that He had","to sacrifice"]],[1242,["His own wife for the sake of His own state."]],[1248,["He did that and He had to ask His wife","who was pregnant"]],[1253,["to go and live with a very great sage."]],[1259,["One may say that, “What was He doing","about His wife?”"]],[1263,["She was the Goddess."]],[1266,["She was so remarkable that He was not","bothered about Her."]],[1269,["He was so sure of Her powers that He","did it."]],[1273,["And there is nothing wrong in leaving","things to the Goddess to do,"]],[1276,["instead of meddling with Her all the time."]],[1279,["But this gentleman, Shri Rama, understood","the responsibility of a king"]],[1289,["and that responsibility is lacking in us:"]],[1292,["that responsibility towards ourselves and","towards others."]],[1296,["It is very, very surprising. I mean, I came","from India."]],[1302,["I had never met Englishmen at this close","quarters"]],[1306,["till I came to England, I should say,"]],[1308,["because before that all we met was","missionaries."]],[1311,["All missionaries were terribly responsible"]],[1314,["for converting all the people into","Christianity."]],[1317,["They would get up early in the morning,","take their Bible,"]],[1319,["go around to all the places, clean all","the dirty lanes"]],[1324,["and clean all the children like Pickwick","Papers, you see!"]],[1327,["Clean all the dirty people there, kiss them"]],[1331,["and do all the impressive things to convert","the people."]],[1334,["They would go even to the forest to convert","them."]],[1337,["They were so responsible about it and they","felt they have to do it,"]],[1340,["this is God’s job, they are doing God’s","job, they must convert."]],[1343,["And they went on with this and that’s how,","some of the people I met."]],[1347,["Then the rulers were extremely responsible."]],[1351,["They were ruthless and they thought this","was the greatest thing they were doing,"]],[1354,["was to spread British Raj and that was","their responsibility."]],[1357,["When it comes to spreading God’s Raj","we are not."]],[1361,["First of all in our own life, we should","see, “Are we responsible?”"]],[1365,["Now, in the modern time, I find"]],[1368,["that we have got rid of that sense","of responsibility."]],[1372,["It’s called as a sense of diminishing","responsibility."]],[1377,["We’ll just say, “Yes, yes, I know.","I shouldn’t. I know, I know.”"]],[1383,["I can’t understand: if you have a heart,","how can you say that"]],[1387,["“I know I should not have done it”? “I know","I should have been this.”"]],[1390,["The reason is, there is no heart and","the heart always catches"]],[1394,["when your Right Side over acts."]],[1397,["That means your brain is acting too much"]],[1399,["and there is no real action, the output","of it."]],[1402,["You think too much and do not put it","to practice."]],[1407,["“I should have gone,” “I should have","done this,”"]],[1409,["“I should have said so.” And this is","the problem with our Right Side."]],[1414,["Now, among our Sahaja Yogis also, I find"]],[1418,["people have the problem of the Right Side."]],[1421,["To worship the Right Side, we have to see","to Shri Ram:"]],[1426,["How He felt responsible for the whole","world,"]],[1430,["how He used to look after people,"]],[1432,["how He looked after the things of other","people,"]],[1435,["how He behaved towards other people."]],[1438,["That’s a very important thing which we","have to learn."]],[1441,["But I find people coming, if it is somebody","else’s, they’ll throw away."]],[1445,["They will just jump into something and","say that,"]],[1448,["“All right, this is my house, I just settle","down here the way I like.”"]],[1452,["There’s no sense of responsibility at all","about it,"]],[1455,["that you have come to somebody else’s","house,"]],[1458,["you have to have some care about it."]],[1460,["In the same way you have to know you have","come in the world of God,"]],[1464,["this is the Kingdom of God where you have","entered."]],[1468,["You have been a stranger. Today you are","a guest in His house,"]],[1472,["what are you doing about it?"]],[1474,["How are you behaving? Are you responsible?"]],[1478,["Are you like Shri Rama who took upon","Himself"]],[1482,["all the problems of the world and still He","was so responsible?"]],[1487,["He would not do anything even this much","to disturb a person."]],[1492,["As far as possible He would like to try","to console,"]],[1498,["and to have the formalities of good living."]],[1501,["Formality is meant for good living and","good understanding."]],[1505,["Unless and until you have this sense","of responsibility,"]],[1508,["your collectivity cannot be all right."]],[1512,["You cannot be collectively all right."]],[1514,["You need not be a machine for that.","There is no need to be a machine,"]],[1518,["like Japanese — only one person says,","the another doesn’t talk."]],[1521,["But this one kind of a funny individualism","that you have got"]],[1524,["will never give you that collectivity that","is expected of Sahaj Yogis."]],[1531,["We all have to be one, being responsible","for each other."]],[1537,["Not only for one or two persons, because","he is my friend,"]],[1540,["he is my husband, she is my wife but","for all of us."]],[1543,["We have to be responsible for them,","for their things, for their children,"]],[1547,["for their house, for everything. We have","to be responsible."]],[1551,["And if this sense of responsibility is","lacking,"]],[1554,["how will you have responsibility for your","Self-realisation?"]],[1560,["Only it can be a self-centred thing,","thinking that,"]],[1563,["“I am very much better, my powers are","better. I must have more powers.”"]],[1568,["But if you do not have this sense","of responsibility"]],[1570,["why should God also give you powers?"]],[1576,["The main thing is, your Right Side is","completely weakened,"]],[1580,["that is the Surya Nadi, that is the nadi","which is called as the nadi"]],[1586,["by which people hold their prana. So it","gives you the pranashakti."]],[1590,["It’s the pranashakti within you which is","the vital force of energy within you,"]],[1595,["which is lacking. Now this lacking is added","up by your heart."]],[1601,["At least for a man like that whose","pranashakti is exhausted."]],[1605,["At least for such a man if the heart is","there,"]],[1608,["he can really use that power which is","accumulating in the head"]],[1613,["and exhausting him, like eating up","his brain,"]],[1617,["if he has the heart in him."]],[1619,["Now this is what I have told you last time"]],[1622,["that the Right Side of human beings","is very important"]],[1626,["when it comes to Sahaj Yoga."]],[1630,["Because, when the Kundalini rises,"]],[1633,["your Right Side is also, Right Side is also","awakened."]],[1638,["Now the question is: why Sahaja Yoga does","not spread in England so fast?"]],[1643,["Is a very good question many people have","asked me."]],[1645,["While in Australia it spreads so fast."]],[1649,["The reason is the Right Side is missing."]],[1653,["For the Right Side to be awakened"]],[1655,["first of all there should be some Right","Side!"]],[1657,["If there is no Right Side, what do you","awaken?"]],[1660,["If there is no light at all what are you","going to awaken?"]],[1663,["There has to be a lamp to be awakened."]],[1666,["So all these topics and talks that we have","in the society,"]],[1670,["“I know! I know!” and then you ask them","they just say, “I don’t know!”"]],[1675,["“How are you?” Like that. All these accents","and all that, one should give up."]],[1682,["One should know that you have to be","responsible:"]],[1685,["that’s a very, very important thing","of life."]],[1688,["I personally think, unless and until you","feel that responsibility,"]],[1693,["that heart into Sahaja Yoga, you will enjoy","just my talk"]],[1696,["as you would just enjoy anything else."]],[1700,["Real enjoyment comes when your Spirit","really blows out the vibrations."]],[1707,["You are taking my vibrations, all right, you","are feeling them, but what about yours?"]],[1711,["Are you blowing your vibrations out or they","are just eating your brain?"]],[1715,["Simple questions is, are you blowing any","vibrations outside?"]],[1720,["We have some Sahaja Yogis when they just","enter into a house"]],[1724,["immediately everyone feels it. Everyone","can feel it that somebody has come."]],[1731,["Immediately the whole thing cools down","in no time. Somebody has come."]],[1735,["There are some here also, not that there","are none, but they are few people."]],[1741,["You have to blow out vibrations otherwise","you are just a liability to yourself."]],[1746,["Why don’t you blow out vibrations? Because","you don’t feel responsible."]],[1750,["In your day-to-day life, morning till","evening, you have to see"]],[1753,["that you develop this instrument of","responsibility within you,"]],[1757,["otherwise the vibrations won’t flow","because, the main reason is"]],[1761,["that our nervous system comes to us through","our Right Side."]],[1771,["Our nervous system is built up by our","Right Side."]],[1777,["All the elements within us have built [it]","up. If the elements are weakened,"]],[1781,["if the chakras which are made by these","elements —"]],[1783,["as you know all these chakras are made","by elements —"]],[1787,["if the pot is weak, nothing is going","to work out."]],[1790,["You should be able to hold that water","of love"]],[1797,["or you can say the water of bliss"]],[1800,["and should be able to pour it out","to others."]],[1802,["Unless and until you are able to do that,","Sahaja Yoga won’t spread."]],[1807,["It will spread very slowly."]],[1809,["This is the difference, I feel, between","English and Australians,"]],[1816,["that the quality of mind is thousands times","better than Australians."]],[1819,["They are not scholars. I found very few","people there who are even graduates."]],[1825,["Here everybody is a PhD or maybe a ‘MAD’:"]],[1829,["but they are all very well educated."]],[1832,["Despite all that, Sahaj Yoga does not","spread out, why?"]],[1836,["The reason is the quality of mind is good"]],[1839,["but the action is extremely poor,"]],[1842,["because you are exhausted, tired, you are","fighting in the mind."]],[1845,["You are not doing anything by which you","blow it out."]],[1850,["The Right Side is what you call the","Brahma’s, Brahmadeva’s, creation"]],[1859,["and the Brahma Shakti as they call it."]],[1863,["This is the power of Brahma which is","flowing through you."]],[1866,["Wec all it the power of the Spirit."]],[1869,["It’s true, but the Spirit, the power","of the Spirit,"]],[1873,["flows on your central nervous system."]],[1876,["If there is the electricity all stored up","here and there are very weak wires"]],[1882,["what can you do with all that stored up","energy?"]],[1885,["The wires have to be improved and for","this wire"]],[1887,["your Right Side has to be improved","immensely."]],[1892,["Every minute you have to be responsible,","and this is what is lacking."]],[1898,["Then I find when some people who are","responsible, they feel extremely hurt"]],[1903,["and they feel that they should really shout","and scream and should do something."]],[1908,["hey don’t know that these are really","the saints, they are realised souls."]],[1911,["They are great people, no doubt, but their","Right Side is weakened."]],[1918,["But that is not a great thing to accept,","it’s a very bad thing."]],[1920,["But that doesn’t mean you should feel","guilty — again, I am saying."]],[1923,["Because very nice! This is the way we","manage: is to feel guilty."]],[1927,["Because feeling guilty is the best way,","“I’m sorry, I’m sorry."]],[1931,["I should have done it. I know, I know,","I know!” — finished!"]],[1936,["Then how can you improve? If you have","a pouch here"]],[1938,["filled up (of guilt in Left Vishuddhi) all","the time with responsibility denied,"]],[1945,["all the junk you have created out of that,","you are pushing into that pouch"]],[1949,["and then you say, “Yes, yes, I know,","I should not have done it!”"]],[1953,["Now what can you do? As a Mother","you can’t say,"]],[1955,["“You hang yourself by the nearest tree!”","What do I do?"]],[1959,["But I just look at you flabbergasted,","I said, “Really?”"]],[1962,["He said: “Yes, I should have done but","I haven’t done it.”"]],[1964,["For example, I tell somebody you’d better","cook for ten people, they are coming. (...)"]],[1971,["That’s how you are at a standstill and you","really don’t know how to deal with them!"]],[1975,["The point is: in all this talking of Spirit","and God,"]],[1979,["one has to know [that] the vehicle has","to be better."]],[1983,["The vehicle is so very poor that it cannot","carry:"]],[1986,["otherwise you will emit vibrations like","this. I know you can."]],[1990,["Wherever you will stand you’ll attract","people."]],[1993,["People must gather round you! You will","be amazed,"]],[1996,["I went to Australia for how many months?"]],[1998,["At the most a month or so, and I came back","from there:"]],[2002,["already seven centres have started"]],[2004,["and every centre has got at least three","hundred regular people coming!"]],[2015,["It is not to feel guilty: I am not saying","[for that],"]],[2019,["but to awaken yourself, to arise to this","point,"]],[2025,["to be elated with understanding that you","have to rise up to that point"]],[2030,["and that you have to take up that position"]],[2032,["because you are the warriors of Truth."]],[2035,["You are the people who are seekers, you","have been for ages,"]],[2038,["and you have no business to be","irresponsible and you have to do it."]],[2043,["It is my earnest desire that you understand","what I am saying."]],[2050,["Just sitting, meditating, putting hands","towards me"]],[2052,["or towards the photograph is not","everything."]],[2056,["You are still receiving. You are still","at a receiving end."]],[2059,["You have to be on the giving end. How","will you do it?"]],[2062,["You get so many vibrations sometimes","that you cannot feel after some time,"]],[2067,["it’s so filled, the pitcher is so much","filled."]],[2069,["But what about pouring it out? Why you","cannot pour it out?"]],[2074,["The reason is that the vehicle within you,"]],[2076,["which is the Right Side, is the Pingala","Nadi, is out of gear."]],[2082,["And this is what one has to understand."]],[2085,["That can be built up only when you know"]],[2087,["about Shri Rama’s life, the way He led","His life."]],[2090,["Every minute of His life was dynamic."]],[2094,["Not a single minute He wasted in life."]],[2098,["Every minute, whether He was in the forest","or…"]],[2102,["He went to a place with His wife when He","was in exile,"]],[2109,["and there — He knew His wife was a very","shy lady"]],[2112,["and She would not take Her bath in","the open."]],[2115,["So there’s a rock which is completely","honed out,"]],[2119,["such a big rock honed out, can you imagine?","(a place called Sitanani near Rahuri)"]],[2122,["Inside, there is a water tap sort of","a thing coming out,"]],[2128,["there’s a water coming out. So there’s","a stone here,"]],[2132,["stone here, stone there, and at the end","of it there’s an opening"]],[2136,["so that there’s light coming from this side","and light coming from this side."]],[2140,["But inside [if] you go, nobody can see you."]],[2142,["There are trees with which it is hidden."]],[2144,["There are trees which are called as","shikakai (used as hair shampoo)"]],[2147,["means that’s a kind of a soap giving trees,","are created by Him for His wife."]],[2152,["Anywhere He lived He created a new","dimension,"]],[2155,["a new house, a new style of life."]],[2160,["Of course He was an incarnation you can","say."]],[2163,["But He is your ideal and not those people","who sit out for hours together"]],[2169,["drinking something and thinking they are","great martyrs."]],[2174,["I see all of them sitting near our church","here"]],[2177,["and one of them was asked by someone","who was passing by,"]],[2179,["“What are you doing?” “We are killing","ourselves!”"]],[2183,["Very proudly saying that! I mean I just","don’t understand,"]],[2187,["what business have they got to kill","themselves?"]],[2189,["How much time it has taken God to create","them?"]],[2191,["And here they are sitting and proudly","telling that, “We are killing ourselves!”"]],[2198,["This is the situation in which I suddenly","find myself."]],[2201,["So I ask you what should I do? How should","I do?"]],[2205,["You have to feel responsible in every way","of life."]],[2213,["But you do not think that there is anything","wrong"]],[2215,["if you are a hanky-panky person."]],[2218,["If your feathers are falling everywhere","[you think] it’s all right!"]],[2222,["To you it does not matter, but to","the Divine it does."]],[2226,["That means a person cannot convey","the message of God,"]],[2231,["cannot communicate the bliss of God,","cannot pour that love."]],[2240,["We have to become very responsible","in everyday life,"]],[2245,["I am not saying that [only] in Sahaja Yoga,","but in everyday life,"]],[2248,["how you live, what you do. Are you only","worried about yourself"]],[2252,["or are you worried about others? Are you","responsible for others?"]],[2255,["I mean the modern style is not even to wish","good morning —"]],[2258,["is regarded bad manners."]],[2262,["You see, it is bad manners even to open","door to someone, is bad manners,"]],[2267,["they think it is slavish. I mean, all","manners and all those things,"]],[2270,["all responsibility, seems to be [regarded","as] slavish."]],[2272,["And this kind of these modern ideas that","are floating in the air,"]],[2276,["you should throw them away!"]],[2278,["And you have to be human beings of a very","great quality."]],[2282,["You have to be people who have created","new worlds."]],[2286,["You are going to create that, I know."]],[2289,["You have to just rise up to that point and","not to sink into your guilts"]],[2293,["and say, “Oh God, what we have been","doing?” No!"]],[2295,["Awaken and arise and get it what you have","to do."]],[2301,["That’s what I feel about England."]],[2304,["England is so great and it’s the heart,","it’s the heart."]],[2309,["And look at the condition of the heart!"]],[2312,["Your heart is so weak, there’s no heart","to anything."]],[2323,["All right, you love me and I love you,"]],[2326,["but what about you loving others? And","loving other things?"]],[2330,["Loving doesn’t mean writing love letters."]],[2335,["Doing something about it!"]],[2338,["And that’s what, the doing something is","missing and lacking."]],[2343,["And that’s what we have to build up our","Right Side properly, into proper shape."]],[2348,["If we have to really do the cooking"]],[2352,["we have to know how to light the fire","within us"]],[2355,["and not to sit down and worry how to do it."]],[2359,["It is a very great thing to come to","England for me, really, for one reason"]],[2366,["that this is the place where Sahaj Yoga","is going to work out."]],[2371,["It is going to circulate in the whole","world, I know, through you people."]],[2376,["But if you do not improve the communication","wires of yours"]],[2383,["it will completely stagnate, and the","responsibility of this stagnation"]],[2387,["will be on you the Sahaja Yogis of London,"]],[2390,["because you did not put your life together,","that’s why it did not work out."]],[2396,["It’s a tremendous responsibility."]],[2400,["Of course, to be responsible is wrong for","wrong things"]],[2405,["but not to be responsible for Divine work,"]],[2410,["when God has blessed you with","Self-realisation,"]],[2414,["is absolutely against God, against your","Self, against Sahaj Yoga."]],[2423,["The other personality which I was talking","about is Shri Hanumana."]],[2428,["Shri Hanumana is such a great powerful","personality"]],[2432,["about whom I did not tell you."]],[2435,["That, I mean, Rama once, you see, His","brother was hit by an arrow."]],[2445,["And Rama told Hanumana, that, “Why don’t","you go"]],[2449,["and get a particular type of a medicine","for him"]],[2454,["and you get it on a particular mountain,"]],[2457,["so you go and get that particular thing.”"]],[2460,["So he had a power, he had nine powers,","navadha shaktis he had, nine powers:"]],[2466,["by which he could become small, he could","become big"]],[2469,["and He could lift anything. He had lots","of powers like that,"]],[2472,["so nine powers: anima, laghima, garima,","like that."]],[2476,["He could become so heavy that nobody could","lift him (garima)."]],[2479,["I mean these are the powers he’s got","of the right hand side."]],[2483,["And so he went down to that mountain"]],[2488,["and he couldn’t see that anywhere, he just","couldn’t see."]],[2491,["He said, “Why not take the whole mountain?”"]],[2494,["He took the whole mountain on himself and","he brought it to Rama"]],[2497,["and he said, “Now you select whichever","you like!”"]],[2502,["He could have come back and said, “Oh,","I can’t find!"]],[2504,["I am sorry, I know, I have been useless!”","If he was an Englishman!"]],[2513,["But he said, “All right, if you want!”","He brought the whole mountain,"]],[2517,["“Now come along, have it!” In every way","of his life,"]],[2521,["you see his sense of responsibility and how","He carries on."]],[2525,["For example, he was sent to Ravana"]],[2529,["and he was asked by Ravana, he told him","that,"]],[2536,["“You cannot stay in this place, why did you","come here?”"]],[2539,["Actually, first he went to Sita and told","Her that,"]],[2544,["“Shri Rama had sent me,” and he showed","the ring,"]],[2546,["and She recognised that was the ring","of Her husband."]],[2549,["And he said, “Mother if you want, I can","take you on my back.”"]],[2554,["But She said, “No. Already I am a woman","who has come with another man."]],[2558,["You [I?] don’t want to have another bad","name and you’ll have a bad name,"]],[2561,["so I will not come. So it’s all right."]],[2564,["You can go back and tell Rama that I am","all right."]],[2568,["‘You as a husband, come and fight this man."]],[2571,["Otherwise I’m not going to come with you.”"]],[2574,["So then he was caught up and taken","to Ravana."]],[2577,["Now Ravana said that, “You are a monkey","and what have you come to do it?”"]],[2585,["He said that, “You’d better release His","wife of Shri Rama"]],[2589,["and He is such and such.”"]],[2591,["So He said that, “You monkey, you are","telling me these things?”"]],[2595,["“All right,” they said, “burn his tail.”"]],[2598,["He said, “If they burn my tail, I know how","to use!”"]],[2601,["He knows how the responsibility of the tail","is!"]],[2604,["He started burning the whole of Lanka with","his tail"]],[2607,["and he could have said that, “All right,","he’s burnt my thing,"]],[2612,["I’d better run away! Why to do such","a thing?"]],[2615,["You know, better avoid, get out, so","forget it!"]],[2619,["I’m not going to go to Rama, he’s burnt","my thing,"]],[2621,["tomorrow he will do something else.”"]],[2624,["[Instead] he burnt the whole of Lanka,","the whole of it he burnt"]],[2628,["till Ravana had to say, that, “Please","forgive and go away.”"]],[2631,["He did all kinds of tricks to show that he","was really powerful."]],[2638,["His so many ways of his sense of","responsibility"]],[2640,["and his dedication and love is expressed."]],[2643,["But, they say that, even if you take once","his name,"]],[2649,["whatever work you want to do, it can be","done."]],[2654,["Any work that you want to be finished","will be done."]],[2658,["And his day is a Tuesday. On Tuesday,"]],[2662,["if you request him for anything, he will","help you to do the work."]],[2665,["But it’s not like this that you sit down,","“Now come along Hanumana,"]],[2668,["will you please do this job?”"]],[2672,["But if you are doing the job, then he comes","to help you."]],[2675,["Means that he activates, he activates and","he makes your energy"]],[2681,["flow into that direction that your work","is done."]],[2685,["He’s so helpful in so many ways that you","can’t imagine."]],[2691,["We have so many Sahaja Yogis have tried","it with them."]],[2694,["And he has created such miracles. Specially","the Australians,"]],[2698,["somehow they have such a feeling for him,","I know the reason,"]],[2701,["but they have such a feeling for him that","every time, anything happening,"]],[2705,["they tell Hanumana, “Hanumana, now please","look after us!”"]],[2709,["And they have told me that such miraculous","things have happened"]],[2713,["since they have been using Shri Hanumana."]],[2715,["But you must have the vehicle to carry","this Hanumana!"]],[2718,["He’s a very subtle Deity within you and if","you are irresponsible,"]],[2721,["he hates such people, he hates, he just","can’t bear it."]],[2727,["He thinks they are absolutely useless","people!"]],[2731,["He doesn’t pay attention to such people,","those who are not responsible."]],[2734,["They may give any excuses, they may","show off,"]],[2736,["they may do anything, [but] he just doesn’t","care for such people."]],[2739,["He has no love, no respect, no attention","for the people who are not responsible."]],[2747,["There’s a very nice English saying, “God","helps those who help themselves.”"]],[2752,["English language has so many beautiful","things in it,"]],[2755,["all its nursery rhymes and everything."]],[2757,["I wish people would not just utter those","sayings but do it."]],[2761,["They listen to me but they don’t do it."]],[2763,["Now you have heard me today,"]],[2766,["you should see how much responsible you","are."]],[2769,["Now we had our first ashram and if there","are others,"]],[2773,["please excuse me, because it’s an open","thing and we have to talk about it."]],[2777,["And I was surprised that in our first","ashram, when I went there,"]],[2781,["I was amazed! I mean, young people living","like pigs!"]],[2787,["I couldn’t understand. I mean, they are","not hippies,"]],[2790,["they are not taking any smokes, drinks,","or anything."]],[2794,["They are so irresponsible! They go","to the bathroom,"]],[2798,["they come out as if a bull in a china shop","has entered!"]],[2803,["And they really live like that, I was","amazed! How could they?"]],[2806,["And they were all graduates, MADs, PhDs,","and everything."]],[2809,["I was wondering, “What has happened","to these people?”"]],[2813,["Slowly, slowly they improved. But this lot","went away"]],[2816,["then a new lot came in and a new lot","came in."]],[2819,["And it’s so surprising that once they","become responsible and good,"]],[2824,["somehow or other Hanumana takes them out,"]],[2830,["and they just get out of it."]],[2832,["Now, I have to tell you to determine today,","to decide,"]],[2836,["that every moment and movement of your life"]],[2841,["you are going to feel responsible as","Hanumana does."]],[2845,["Any work you tell Him: about Him it is said","that,"]],[2850,["“Har kaarje karne ko, tat par.”"]],[2854,["Means for doing any work, he is just ready!","He’s just ready!"]],[2860,["You tell him anything, he’s just ready","to do it."]],[2865,["It is his quality that you should have."]],[2869,["And that quality is so much lacking today","in England."]],[2872,["All your strikes, all your problems can","be solved."]],[2877,["First time when I came, I was surprised,","I asked somebody,"]],[2880,["“Are you working?” He said, “No, I am","successfully unemployed!”"]],[2886,["I said, “Really? You are successfully","unemployed so how do you eat?”"]],[2891,["“Oh, we get our doles.” “Oh really?”","“We have securities.”"]],[2896,["What a security, it is nonsense, you are","parasite!"]],[2901,["There is no self-respect. Leave alone","the respect of others,"]],[2905,["there’s no self-respect. I was amazed!"]],[2910,["Then I told them, “All of you have to take","to work."]],[2912,["Anybody who takes to doles is not going","to stay in the ashram.”"]],[2919,["I wish your government can take some note","of it!"]],[2922,["That we have to create responsible","citizens."]],[2926,["In England itself, we have to show that by","Sahaj Yoga you have turned the tables,"]],[2931,["you have got smart people now, efficient,","responsible."]],[2937,["This is what we have to show. Once you","show this to others,"]],[2941,["people will be amazed at it!"]],[2945,["With other’s money [it’s] the same thing."]],[2947,["If you can get hold of somebody else’s","money that’s the best thing!"]],[2951,["It’s a very common feature."]],[2954,["First time the Sahaja Yogis went to India","they came back here,"]],[2959,["they never wrote a letter back, thanking","them. And I was amazed."]],[2964,["For six months, I said, “What are you","doing?”"]],[2966,["“I know we should have written. I know","we should have written.”"]],[2968,["“Then why? Why didn’t you write?”"]],[2972,["No responsibility! What is this, I could","not understand."]],[2978,["Gradually they developed and developed","and developed. Now they feel."]],[2983,["But those who have started feeling are","the matured Sahaja Yogis I should say."]],[2987,["But others who are coming to it must know"]],[2989,["that you have to have a sense","of responsibility."]],[2992,["Sometimes people who are realised have","a feeling,"]],[2995,["“Oh, now we are realised! Now, nothing!"]],[2998,["Settle down, have the bliss of Mother.","Sit down and enjoy it,”"]],[3003,["Nothing doing! It will stop!"]],[3006,["You have to be able to give this to others,","you should emit."]],[3010,["If you cannot emit those vibrations","yourself…"]],[3015,["If you are enlightened, you should be able","to give light to others."]],[3018,["You can raise the Kundalini, all right, but","what about your own personality"]],[3024,["which is so irresponsible? Which is nowhere","near Hanumana’s."]],[3030,["This Hanumana style of complete obedience","to your being,"]],[3039,["the complete emission of that love that","you have received,"]],[3044,["that Divine Power you have received."]],[3046,["Unless and until you achieve that state"]],[3049,["you should not be satisfied with your","Self-realisation."]],[3053,["Self-realisation is only complete when you","yourself become the giver of light."]],[3063,["You the guru, you the great stars: that’s","my ambition."]],[3069,["I know I expect [a lot] sometimes from","my children."]],[3075,["And I want them to understand that I want","you to be really honoured"]],[3085,["in the Kingdom of God as great sons","of your Mother."]],[3090,["May God bless you."]],[3093,["Left Side also, you know that, but keep","it up."]],[3100,["I do correct, by saying all these things."]],[3104,["I do awaken Hanumana and Shri Rama within","you, no doubt, I know that."]],[3109,["But keep them awake, keep them alert."]],[3116,["And you have to be alert and active,"]],[3121,["responsible and respectable."]],[3127,["You have to realise that you are saints,"]],[3132,["saints of a very special quality."]],[3135,["The saints who can give realisations","to others!"]],[3139,["There have been not such saints, many,","before,"]],[3142,["nor even today, there are saints who are","realised souls"]],[3145,["but they don’t know how to give","realisation."]],[3148,["They don’t know so much. You have so much","of knowledge and everything,"]],[3153,["except the vehicle is poor, it cannot carry","the bliss."]],[3163,["And the cup has to be all right otherwise","it cannot carry"]],[3170,["the beautiful fountain of love that is","pouring down on this Earth."]],[3180,["And that is how you must know that, within","you this is awakened,"]],[3185,["keep it awakened, keep it going."]],[3192,["Please close your eyes, [feet] straight","on the ground."]],[3198,["Put both the hands towards me like that."]],[3203,["Thoughts are gone now, there are no","thoughts."]],[3205,["So even if you want to feel guilty you","cannot."]],[3210,["There’s nothing to feel guilty. It is to","awaken"]],[3212,["within yourself, that fire of Spirit,"]],[3218,["that makes you express and emit."]],[3231,["We have to move very fast. We have","to achieve it very fast."]],[3235,["There isn’t much time left for us."]],[3239,["It’s easy to say that, “It’s rather","difficult,” and all that."]],[3243,["These things are not to be talked by us."]],[3246,["This is meant for some dramas and things."]],[3250,["It’s not for people who are chosen by God."]],[3261,["Just lift your hands a little bit and","you’ll feel it in the hands."]],[3269,["Better now? Right side opening very much!"]],[3276,["Not to have any fright, nothing."]],[3278,["You know your Mother can never be angry","with you, never."]],[3281,["But I have to awaken them. That I love","you very much,"]],[3286,["that I want you to have your due:"]],[3291,["all the heralds and all the glory."]],[3300,["Close your eyes now and let it go, let it","flow."]],[3306,["See the responsibility of the Spirit is","so great."]],[3309,["Whatever may be your vehicle, once it is","awakened"]],[3312,["it gives Realisation to others, it acts."]],[3315,["Be responsible like that Spirit."]],[3322,["If you become the Spirit you will be like","that Spirit."]],[3336,["Close your eyes. Just close your eyes."]],[3344,["By rising your Right Side only you can","really give balance to your Left Side:"]],[3349,["otherwise there is no way out."]],[3356,["You just try to be responsible, you will be","amazed."]],[3362,["You just try to be responsible and you will","be amazed,"]],[3367,["your all financial problems, all your","problems, will be solved,"]],[3373,["because you are awakened!"]],[3377,["And you have a special power."]],[3380,["You have to be just this power!"]],[3383,["The responsibility becomes a heavenly power","within you."]],[3394,["Get the power from your heart."]],[3397,["Put your heart into it. Put your heart."]],[3401,["Put all these things into your heart:","“I have to do it from my heart!"]],[3405,["I have to be responsible from my heart."]],[3412,["I have to be innately responsible.”"]]]);
